               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Audio Guestbook Rental Agreement</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Audio Guestbook Rental Agreement</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>This agreement is between Kaitlyn Gledhill, doing business as L</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>This agreement is between Kaitlyn Gledhill, doing business as Leave a Message (â€œweâ€), and the client named below (â€œyouâ€), for the rental of a vintage rotary-style audio guestbook.  Client Information Name Phone Email Event type Event date Event location  Rental details Drop-off or pick-up date Return date How would you like to get the phone? (check one)    Please deliver and pick up the phone (available in the Raleigh-Durham, NC area)       Iâ€™ll pick up and return the phone myself (Raleigh-Durham, NC area)  Message delivery How would you like your recordings? (check one)    Email (free)       USB memory stick (+$20) If you chose USB, please add a mailing address  </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
